            <div xml:id="m-cb3ea52f-9070-4058-8f92-794fee901cb7">
              <lg xml:id="m-8cd24f0b-0cae-4103-a9c9-8a5c21d76e5f">
                <l xml:id="m-492d53a8-86fc-47ec-8518-6293eb022c1f" facs="#m-548b4b7e-9dea-4701-a296-9b0bf1a293f4" label="ambiguous">Ash Wednesday.</l><l xml:id="m-76f3bde3-e887-43f1-80cb-bc05ae1e8c00" facs="#m-fc1a98fb-5f86-4bfb-9c7d-6ee3e8e3731f" label="ambiguous">525</l><l xml:id="m-46ae55bd-63c6-4a51-8905-ea8cbb6f81ea" facs="#m-8e2df3cf-cf3c-420f-949b-99a642eb0041" label="lyrics-like">Gló- ri-a Pátri, et Fi-li¬</l><l xml:id="m-27e670a2-3fb5-44d9-b64b-b22888af211a" facs="#m-f68654ad-ab7f-486b-9912-381ab3166903" label="lyrics-like">et Spi-rí¬</l><l xml:id="m-875447a0-fb70-405f-883e-bd4bdc1750e1" facs="#m-72414769-ba64-4ad3-aaf9-578ed961b664" label="lyrics-like">tu-i Sán¬</l><l xml:id="m-09ff6911-420e-40a9-b26f-657eb2e1d8c6" facs="#m-d62f1890-f590-4cbe-9c2d-91f437c15d99" label="ambiguous">0,</l><l xml:id="m-7bd60140-0a2c-4976-8f40-56b2977bb7f5" facs="#m-c6b77352-227a-4532-b3aa-d323c7c6c9d3" label="lyrics-like">cto. — Atténde.</l><l xml:id="m-9c64239c-8290-4681-a7b4-c457afbe25fe" facs="#m-68b99816-cc76-4824-9e44-178f1a7c97fc" label="text-like">While placing the ashes on the foreheads of the faithful, the Celebrant says:</l><l xml:id="m-aaf9ef41-3fd7-4975-a963-c11871c0f991" facs="#m-7fa224d7-7ee4-4119-a472-1a9cf99af343" label="lyrics-like">V. Meménto, homo, quia pulvis es, et in púlverem revertéris.</l><l xml:id="m-ec667bb1-c295-4c51-9f4f-e72c966a0984" facs="#m-53cfc6e1-99dd-424b-bb60-77165eabb371" label="text-like">Aner the distribution of the ashes, the Celebrant says</l><l xml:id="m-ae3fcb4a-bf3d-4dc6-b429-109899cfeee3" facs="#m-570c3f5a-193b-48e6-a4ac-715a341ddf74" label="lyrics-like">V. Dóminus vobíscum. R. Et cum spíritu túo.</l><l xml:id="m-3b1fcb2f-edff-421f-945a-d01042e96fe3" facs="#m-5612d365-5b44-493d-9b39-2a759aff967e" label="lyrics-like">Orémus.</l><l xml:id="m-5ad3ecdd-eb32-4798-b8ad-d41217fa8d73" facs="#m-8d60cba2-edab-4298-8d75-237834b89a84" label="lyrics-like">voncéde nobis, Dómine, praesídia! nequítias pugnatúri continéntiae</l><l xml:id="m-0d0b0376-a8d4-45e7-b56b-0a1e6002e78a" facs="#m-2c7aa828-491c-4be1-89e5-895344114e36" label="lyrics-like">L militiae christiánae sanctis in¬</l><l xml:id="m-881fef13-397e-43b6-ba1b-a1915b18ab2b" facs="#m-8426b315-78fe-4bd0-a401-c9cc8f5326b6" label="lyrics-like">muniámur auxiliis. Per Christum.</l><l xml:id="m-b6014a62-c3c3-4d7b-ae74-6a8172f0dbfa" facs="#m-699d2d99-0a08-4a39-a85e-707521bf0936" label="lyrics-like">choâre jejúniis : ut contra spiritáles</l><l xml:id="m-78338fed-b1cd-47c5-97df-817f7ac920ba" facs="#m-15cb7660-a451-41c7-b72e-e3c46f96d778" label="text-like">Mass is then said.</l><l xml:id="m-b44759e0-03a7-4e98-b452-8e5582a945b5" facs="#m-c20449e6-d342-401d-856b-3edc594e504a" label="text-like">AT MASS.</l><l xml:id="m-99e0827e-ff58-41f3-a84e-25ffd29d47ba" facs="#m-80dbd1f2-abf6-4471-bc1f-417faacf6249" label="ambiguous">Intr.</l><l xml:id="m-d52b3315-b0b9-4a60-a9c8-618d4144fe95" facs="#m-4e8de1ad-9cab-49b0-9083-dda328a22e8c" label="ambiguous">1.</l><l xml:id="m-e412b5b6-cd44-4273-9c96-02c1df5ca69f" facs="#m-cf4c7777-2fc4-4d49-8487-fc360a6bc06a" label="lyrics-like">I-se-réris“ ómni-um, Dó-mine,</l><l xml:id="m-feb94c35-7f8b-4cd0-8213-dc627c308fd7" facs="#m-6bc1eca1-adb5-42fd-bb6f-c10db08e2505" label="ambiguous">et ni¬ hil</l><l xml:id="m-0943f278-b774-4d79-b962-5bc97a29ae41" facs="#m-c0f34856-1ef7-4634-abc3-75656d593969" label="lyrics-like">e-ó- rum quae fe-cí-sti, dissímu-lans pec¬</l><l xml:id="m-9edc004e-9686-4fd9-825c-451020c63700" facs="#m-5d10c57d-427e-4e08-ac32-1c14b5aa33c2" label="lyrics-like">odísti</l><l xml:id="m-dbcd00ce-7472-446c-ac2f-b7d7b449d8f7" facs="#m-f31fa1d6-56fe-4dd2-b213-2df313ae941b" label="lyrics-like">cá-ta hó-mi- num propter paeni¬ ténti¬</l><l xml:id="m-b38e6960-54cb-4faf-a208-fc85d5bfd79b" facs="#m-7e50ceee-8b32-47d7-bd6b-229864340345" label="ambiguous">et</l><l xml:id="m-87111f8f-f761-4ba3-b69a-3980a58a8525" facs="#m-1a72ac27-4191-41f7-933a-a3bcdf1ba621" label="ambiguous">am,</l><l xml:id="m-2a5db2d7-1ca4-432b-9f7e-a6516e8fd7d0" facs="#m-c275c008-9cb6-4ffe-830f-65a230db1457" label="lyrics-like">es Dó-minus</l><l xml:id="m-7be401a2-8508-4314-a5b5-db1fee29f7c0" facs="#m-fb6e2c8c-6b43-4fe7-87b4-5245bec6a6c0" label="lyrics-like">pár-cens - lis:</l><l xml:id="m-8456848c-ad59-486f-a22d-33b893c253b8" facs="#m-67874a53-616f-48bd-a71a-b2e2d89cf496" label="ambiguous">qui-a tu</l><l xml:id="m-3b7acb1a-6b7b-4af3-9e35-03a878f385be" facs="#m-89e21963-506e-43f7-8659-c617a19b4cc9" label="lyrics-like">Dé¬</l><l xml:id="m-d9767314-dcf5-4133-a936-4c3a2539268e" facs="#m-604a4204-aa01-43c5-98c0-0a20425714ed" label="lyrics-like">ster. Ps. Mi-serére mé-i Dé-us, mi-se¬</l><l xml:id="m-880c2767-6199-4b91-93db-7b1fe11fc304" facs="#m-8ae8ef0e-1322-471b-a9ef-5fce7affc676" label="lyrics-like">nó¬</l><l xml:id="m-ba85c583-9c3d-4f77-8ddb-3ca75d070712" facs="#m-6d6d7b17-483a-4853-b3f7-f4d42e3869e0" label="ambiguous">us</l></lg>
            </div>
